      "message": "fix(test): build the disk_recovery machines path per component\n\nThe test made the folder with join(\"assets/machines\"). On Windows that\npath keeps a '/', and the reader prints '\\'. The contains check failed.\nJoin \"assets\" and \"machines\" one at a time, in the parent and the child.\nThe reader does not change.\n\nFixes #4120\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
